<title>USA: NCAA-MEN'S COLLEGE BASKETBALL TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>NCAA-MEN'S COLLEGE BASKETBALL TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second-round results in the</p>
<p>1997 NCAA men's college basketball tournament Saturday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes regional seeding):</p>
<p>East Region (at Winston-Salem)</p>
<p> 1-North Carolina     73    9-Colorado		56</p>
<p> 5-California	   75    4-Villanova	     68</p>
<p>Southeast Region (at Memphis)</p>
<p> 1-Kansas		 75    8-Purdue		  61</p>
<p> 4-Arizona		73   12-Coll.of Charleston  69</p>
<p>Midwest Region (at Auburn Hills)</p>
<p> 6-Iowa St.	     67    3-Cincinnati	    66</p>
<p> 7-Xavier Ohio	  vs    2-UCLA</p>
<p>West Region (at Salt Lake City)</p>
<p> 4-Josephs Pa.	  81    5-Boston College	77 (OT)</p>
<p> 8-Iowa		   vs    1- Kentucky</p>
</text>
